"<html>Copy the currently selected text or item(s) to the system "
"clipboard<br /><br />This makes it available to the <b>Paste</b> command in "
"Konqueror and other KDE applications.</html>"
msgstr "<html>Kopiraj trenutačno odabrani tekst ili stavke u sistemski međuspremnik<br /><br />Tako će biti dostupni naredbi <b>Zalijepi</b> u Konqueroru i drugim KDE-ovim aplikacijama.</html>"

#: src/konqmainwindow.cpp:3724
#, kde-format
