#: src/konqmainwindow.cpp:5515
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Your proxy configuration can't be used with the QtWebEngine HTML engine. No "
"proxy will be used\n"
"\n"
" QtWebEngine only support a fixed proxy, so proxy auto-configuration (PAC) "
"and Web Proxy Auto-Discovery protocol can't be used with QtWebEngine. If you "
"need a proxy, please select the system proxy configuration or specify a "
"proxy URL manually in the settings dialog. Do you want to change proxy "
"settings now?"
msgstr "Vaša konfiguracija proxyja ne može se koristiti s HTML mehanizmom QtWebEngine. Proxy se neće koristiti.\n\nQtWebEngine podržava samo fiksni proxy pa se automatska konfiguracija proxyja (PAC) i protokol automatskog otkrivanja web-proxyja ne mogu koristiti. Ako vam je potreban proxy, odaberite sistemsku konfiguraciju proxyja ili ručno navedite URL proxyja u dijaloškom okviru postavki. Želite li sada promijeniti postavke proxyja?"

#: src/konqmainwindow.cpp:5520
#, kde-format
msgid "Unsupported proxy configuration"
msgstr "Nepodržana konfiguracija proxyja"

#: src/konqmainwindow.cpp:5520
#, kde-format
msgid "Don't use a proxy"
msgstr "Nemoj koristiti proxy"

#: src/konqmainwindow.cpp:5521 src/konqmainwindow.cpp:5549
#, kde-format
msgid "Show proxy configuration dialog"
msgstr "Prikaži dijaloški okvir konfiguracije proxyja"

#: src/konqmainwindow.cpp:5545
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Your proxy configuration can't be used with the QtWebEngine HTML engine "
"because it doesn't support having different proxies for the HTTP and HTTPS "
"protocols. Your current settings are:<p><b>HTTP proxy:</b> <tt>%1</tt></"
"p><p><b>HTTPS proxy: </b><tt>%2</tt></p>What do you want to do?"
msgstr "Vaša konfiguracija proxyja ne može se koristiti s HTML mehanizmom QtWebEngine jer ne podržava različite proxyje za HTTP i HTTPS protokole. Trenutačne postavke su:<p><b>HTTP proxy:</b> <tt>%1</tt></p><p><b>HTTPS proxy: </b><tt>%2</tt></p>Što želite učiniti?"

#: src/konqmainwindow.cpp:5548
#, kde-format
msgid "Conflicting proxy configuration"
msgstr "Sukobljena konfiguracija proxyja"

#: src/konqmainwindow.cpp:5549
#, kde-format
msgid "Use HTTP proxy (only this time)"
msgstr "Koristi HTTP proxy (samo ovaj put)"

#: src/konqmainwindow.cpp:5549
#, kde-format
msgid "Use HTTPS proxy (only this time)"
msgstr "Koristi HTTPS proxy (samo ovaj put)"

